    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait so u saying the \"well regulated\" part is basically dead weight now? if a state wants to argue that modern tech like ghost guns or high-capacity mags makes old common law analogies irrelevant, is that just a losing battle in court? it seems like the court is just ignoring the reality of modern public safety.",
